Source: var-wireless-utils
Section: embedded
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Matthias Proske <matthias.p@variscite.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/varigit/meta-variscite-bsp-common
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: var-wireless-utils
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 var-wireless-utils-wifi (= ${binary:Version}),
 var-wireless-utils-bt (= ${binary:Version}),
 var-wireless-utils-ot (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Variscite wireless setup utilities (metapackage)
 Install the Wi-Fi, Bluetooth and OpenThread setup helpers for Variscite
 modules. The separate component packages may also be installed individually.

Package: var-wireless-utils-wifi
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Variscite Wi-Fi setup utilities
 Install the common wireless helper functions, the Wi-Fi startup script,
 and the associated systemd unit.

Package: var-wireless-utils-bt
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, var-wireless-utils-wifi (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Variscite Bluetooth setup utilities
 Install the Bluetooth setup script and its systemd unit. The Wi-Fi package
 supplies the shared wireless functions used by this script.

Package: var-wireless-utils-ot
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, var-wireless-utils-bt (= ${binary:Version}), procps
Description: Variscite OpenThread setup utilities
 Install the OpenThread setup script, client and server helpers, and its
 systemd unit. The Bluetooth package is required as in the Yocto recipe.
